  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632355850287120981 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632355850169614933&sectionId=632355850287120981)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6pmn43LDp_text","label":"gg6pmn43LDp_text","default":"<p>Thanksgiving is a time to gather around the table, share good food, and appreciate the people who make life meaningful. This year, give your family more than a traditional present—give them a memory they can build and treasure together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRPpiSXaPs_text","label":"ggRPpiSXaPs_text","default":"<p>For many families, Thanksgiving is one of the few times of year when everyone comes together under one roof. It's a chance to reconnect, share stories, laugh over old memories, and create new ones around the dinner table.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/3ed0bb72-5af4-49ca-9101-93205096e4f3.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_alt","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_alt","default":"Family gathered together celebrating Thanksgiving"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_title","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_title","default":"Family gathered around a Thanksgiving dinner table"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSeUar_tlt_text","label":"ggSeUar_tlt_text","default":"<p>While food may bring everyone to the table, it's the time spent together that makes the holiday truly special. A thoughtful Thanksgiving gift can capture that feeling and give your family something meaningful to remember long after the last slice of pie is gone.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYZeJATo1-_text","label":"ggYZeJATo1-_text","default":"Give a Gift That Brings Everyone Together"},{"type":"html","id":"gginLjfrm9r_text","label":"gginLjfrm9r_text","default":"<p>Some gifts are meant to be opened and admired, while others give you an opportunity to spend time together. Memobrick offers both.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite family photo becomes a custom brick mosaic that everyone can help build, turning gift-giving into a shared experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents, children, grandparents, and siblings can work on the mosaic together, placing each brick piece by piece while talking, laughing, and remembering the moment captured in the photo. By the time it's finished, you've created more than a personalized decoration—you've created another family memory.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM1RX9QZyy_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggM1RX9QZyy_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/837f78c2-d6d7-478e-afb7-87c4e9add5a1.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM1RX9QZyy_alt","label":"ggM1RX9QZyy_alt","default":"Family Thanksgiving celebration with a custom Memobrick mosaic"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM1RX9QZyy_title","label":"ggM1RX9QZyy_title","default":"Family Thanksgiving Memobrick"}],
